# Host files council's suites cannot run without, as paths relative to the
# Minerva checkout root, checked by scripts/run-gd-tests.sh before Godot starts.
# src/project.godot is required for every plugin and is checked unconditionally
# by the runner, so it is not repeated here.
#
# A Minerva SHA bump that moves or drops one of these fails by name instead of
# as a parse error inside the suite.
#
# test_council_panel.gd mounts the panel through the host's own scene-panel
# path and drives the broker that registers it.
src/Scripts/Services/Plugins/PluginScenePanelHost.gd
src/Scripts/Services/Plugins/PluginScenePanelBroker.gd
#
# The manifest is parsed by the host's real parser, and the IPC helper the
# broker attaches is the one the panel awaits its replies on.
src/Scripts/Services/Plugins/PluginDefinition.gd
src/Scripts/Services/Plugins/MinervaIPC.gd
#
# Section 6 speaks to the real backend over the host's own stdio transport.
src/Scripts/Services/MCP/MCPServerConnection.gd
